  drafting --> needs_human_review: runtime blocked
  validating --> needs_human_review: exhausted or unrecoverable failure
  repairing --> needs_human_review: exhausted or unrecoverable failure
  needs_information --> queued: founder verifies facts
  needs_human_review --> queued: verified context changes
